    {
      "text": "在地狱里用黑杰克赢取亡魂硬币，再拿钱贿赂摆渡人换取自由",
      "dimension": "题材",
      "excerpt": "Play Black Jack against the restless souls wandering the hellish afterlife. You play for their coin, and you’ll need lots of them to bribe the ferryman and escape.",
