      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "卡牌可迫使对手继续要牌、改写点数、窥视牌组或直接交换双方手牌",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "The cards will bend and change the rules of the game: Force your opponent to overcommit Increase and decrease their card values Control their deck or peek into your own Swap cards with your opponent Uncover secret combinations within your deck",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/3100370/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "对手从不露面，只能观察双手、打法与诅咒，并通过关系深入了解其故事",
      "dimension": "故事",
      "excerpt": "Opponents are shown only through their hands Familiarize yourself with their playstyle and curses Deepen your relationship with them to break the cycle",
